{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"6d6b77cfa131242b","x":-410,"y":-151,"width":100,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# CeWL"},
		{"id":"fbfd2b3ae7551f3e","x":-310,"y":-369,"width":607,"height":89,"type":"text","text":"**CeWL** ek command-line tool hai jo kisi website ke publicly available content ko crawl karke words collect karta hai aur unse **custom wordlist** banata hai."},
		{"id":"fcec79c873f41544","x":-105,"y":-660,"width":197,"height":240,"type":"text","text":"```\nWebsite Content\n↓\nCeWL Crawl\n↓\nWords Extract\n↓\nWordlist\n```"},
		{"id":"210e0208478b7b7b","x":-205,"y":-177,"width":397,"height":113,"type":"text","text":"> CeWL is a free tool that scan a website and create a `custom wordlist` from that words it find perfect for guessing passwords."},
		{"id":"b597d66f821e8e50","x":341,"y":-166,"width":299,"height":91,"type":"text","text":"```\ncewl https://example.com\n```"},
		{"id":"386481e26df1c2e4","x":314,"y":260,"width":354,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`cewl https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"f2085d48607bd52c","x":914,"y":258,"width":264,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`cewl https://example.com -d 2`"},
		{"id":"4c1c094c495db8a6","x":914,"y":140,"width":264,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"do link `depth` m jayega"},
		{"id":"0b4e8fae40c009b3","x":940,"y":-192,"width":213,"height":234,"type":"text","text":"```\nHomepage\n↓\n\nLinked Pages\n↓\n\nMore Linked Pages\n```"},
		{"id":"991ffbfe7cc97ab5","x":-131,"y":600,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# Examples"},
		{"id":"6321394e550657a0","x":-210,"y":880,"width":409,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Minimum Word Length Set Karna (`-m`)"},
		{"id":"91758feb6bca5da5","x":380,"y":866,"width":418,"height":89,"type":"text","text":"#### Sirf 5 ya usse zyada characters wale words\n`cewl -m 5 https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"5ff6a337d855f5c5","x":-161,"y":1040,"width":311,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Maximum Word Length (`-x`)"},
		{"id":"e7900c9abaecadaa","x":379,"y":1018,"width":438,"height":105,"type":"text","text":"#### 5 se 10 characters ke beech ke words\n`cewl -m 5 -x 10 https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"6c14eb05c63c1c6b","x":-212,"y":1240,"width":411,"height":55,"type":"text","text":"### Numbers Allow Karna (`--with-numbers`)"},
		{"id":"5779f4df830b2e60","x":379,"y":1214,"width":470,"height":106,"type":"text","text":"#### Words with numbers (e.g., \"admin123\")\n`cewl --with-numbers https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"dc3a255c8dea2543","x":-210,"y":1423,"width":409,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"### Custom User-Agent (`-u`)"},
		{"id":"093b35f20c57ebb3","x":379,"y":1386,"width":723,"height":124,"type":"text","text":"#### Fake browser agent bhejne ke liye\n`cewl -u \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)\" https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"9c5f05891f100574","x":379,"y":1560,"width":821,"height":107,"type":"text","text":"#### Basic auth walo site ke liye\n`cewl --auth_type basic --auth_user admin --auth_pass admin123 https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"e5517e005d317e56","x":-167,"y":1580,"width":321,"height":55,"type":"text","text":"### Authentication (Basic/Digest)"},
		{"id":"55ce6d648c34cc63","x":379,"y":1700,"width":841,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"#### Digest auth\n`cewl --auth_type digest --auth_user admin --auth_pass password123 https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"47cd56567ea7e8fa","x":-157,"y":1940,"width":311,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"### Custom Headers (`--header`)"},
		{"id":"7c3b177aeca964f0","x":379,"y":1900,"width":905,"height":130,"type":"text","text":"#### Multiple headers\n`cewl https://example.com --header \"Cookie: session=xyz\" --header \"Authorization: Bearer token\" -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"9b0336efabbf4b2d","x":-124,"y":2232,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Proxy Support"},
		{"id":"3140f4e9ef4e93e6","x":-124,"y":2447,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Exclude Paths"},
		{"id":"029b1954471e7692","x":379,"y":2424,"width":547,"height":106,"type":"text","text":"#### exclude.txt mein paths likhe hain jinko ignore karna hai\n`cewl --exclude exclude.txt https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"0b978a774bbca96d","x":-129,"y":2642,"width":261,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"### Allowed Paths (Regex)"},
		{"id":"e48b81331a909246","x":379,"y":2618,"width":547,"height":98,"type":"text","text":"#### Sirf /blog/ ke andar ke pages crawl karega\n`cewl --allowed \"^/blog/.*\" https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"2d387c98b38707d8","x":-137,"y":2840,"width":278,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### URL Structure Capture"},
		{"id":"b3042841c254f344","x":386,"y":2815,"width":583,"height":110,"type":"text","text":"#### Domain, paths, subdomains capture karega\n`cewl --capture-url-structure https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"520a3ad54ed8e23b","x":386,"y":2980,"width":583,"height":200,"type":"text","text":"#### Sirf subdomains\n`cewl --capture-subdomains https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`\n\n#### Sirf paths\n`cewl --capture-paths https://example.com -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"ecdaed698d67e9f3","x":-272,"y":3260,"width":548,"height":72,"type":"text","text":"> Baki keval flag add karana h koi parameter pass nahi karana"},
		{"id":"95723191724abbd5","x":379,"y":2210,"width":1024,"height":105,"type":"text","text":"#### Proxy with authentication\n`cewl https://example.com --proxy_host 127.0.0.1 --proxy_port 8080 --proxy_username user --proxy_password pass -w wordlist.txt`"},
		{"id":"1cd2d052967daf38","x":-560,"y":630,"width":295,"height":283,"type":"text","text":"| Option    | Purpose                 |\n| --------- | ----------------------- |\n| `-d`      | Crawl depth             |\n| `-m`      | Minimum word length     |\n| `-w`      | Save output             |\n| `-v`      | Verbose output          |\n| `--count` | Word frequency          |\n| `--email` | Extract email addresses |\n| `--meta`  | Extract metadata        |\n| `--ua`    | Custom User-Agent       |\n"}
	],
